{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and pick it up then check properties and move to destination. Otherwise scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectClose    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
